  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Saf-C 4600 CARRIAGE OF HOUSEHOLD GOODS BY MOTOR VEHICLES\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 21-P:14,II(w); RSA 375-A:5, IV and V; RSA 375-A:12, II; RSA 375-A:13, II; and RSA 375-A:14, II\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #13828, effective 12-22-23, readopted with amendment Chapter Saf-C 4600. Amendments included the deletion of some existing rules and insertion of new rules, and the renumbering of various existing rules in Saf-C 4600 as noted in the source notes. Document #13828 replaces all prior filings affecting the former rules in Chapter Saf-C 4600.\n\nDocument #13828 deleted the following rules in the Parts indicated:",
